# Local Claude Code state, except the two routing symlinks. `.claude/*`
# rather than `.claude/` so the negations work — git cannot re-include
# anything under an excluded directory. The contributor skills are no
# longer in here: they live in contributor-skills/ at the repo root and
# are tracked there, which is why this block no longer names them one by
# one. A personal skill dropped through the .claude/skills symlink lands
# in that tracked directory and shows up in git status rather than being
# ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/rules
!.claude/skills

# Superpowers workspaces (never commit)
.superpowers/
